      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Fortune solar provided a smooth solar experience. They explained well the system, using easy to understand language and little techno jargon (did not try to baffle us with BS). Answered any questions well. Provided an initial quote immediately over the phone (at a very substantial saving from the 4 other companies we had quote). Provided a clear written quote the next day with all terms and conditions.Installation schedule was timely, and in fact was brought forward to an earlier date.Installation was carried out well, neat, and in the timeframe noted. After Install energy company contact and grid connection has been on time and well communicated (to date still awaiting grid connection but it is scheduled)Pro's:Great value for money, offers a good mix of premium and standard equipment (we had Fronius inv and std panels installed), short lead time for Install.Cons: (for us at least) Subcontractor Installers used - not employees. Installers not really able to help on the \"software/app\" set up (had to rely on YouTube videos). All communication via phone - no actual onsite visit prior to install.For us the Pro's outweighed the cons as we had a 10kW system installed for $4k less than other companies quoted on a 6.6kW with inferior system components.",
